        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ateneo de Davao University, Society of Jesus, University of Rochester\n- Places: Davao City, Philippines\n- People: Leoncio P. Deriada\n- Topics: university structure, schools, academic programs, education\n\nFacts:\n- In 1959, Leoncio P. Deriada earned a BA in English from Ateneo de Davao University and graduated cum laude.\n- Ateneo de Davao University is a private teaching, service, and research university in Davao City in the Philippines.\n- Ateneo de Davao University is run by the Society of Jesus.\n- Ateneo de Davao University has five undergraduate schools: the School of Arts and Sciences, School of Business and Governance, School of Engineering and Architecture, School of Education, and the School of Nursing.\n- Ateneo de Davao University also runs a grade school and a high school.\n- The University of Rochester has six schools and various interdisciplinary programs.",
